# Vivien Reid, "+1: Look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal a creature or land card from among them and put it
# into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order." The top four are Lightning Bolt, Sol Ring,
# Llanowar Elves and Island. A Bolt or a Sol Ring is no creature or land card, so taking one is refused
# (`! Bot1.Arrange(Lightning Bolt | ...)`); Bot1 takes the Elves. Loyalty goes 5 to 6, and the other three cards go to the bottom.

